docker compose ps

docker compose logs app
docker compose logs app --tail 30

### Rebuilding
        docker compose down
        docker compose up -d --build

### docker compose exec = execute a command inside an already-running container.
        docker compose exec app sh
            whoami
            ls -la /app
            exit
            wget -S -O - http://localhost:8080/

 ### docker compose config = what Compose is going to configure.
 ### docker inspect = what the created container actually has.
        docker inspect climbing-management-sb-app-1



### Docker troubleshooting — deliberate failure #1
### The Spring Boot container cannot connect to PostgreSQL because it is using the wrong hostname.
### Verify Docker DNS with getent hosts postgres and inspect the container configuration with docker inspect.
        docker compose exec app sh
            getent hosts postgres
            getent hosts mongo

### Docker troubleshooting #2 — Health checks
### Container is running  ≠ Application is healthy
        docker inspect climbing-management-sb-app-1 --format '{{json .State.Health}}'